<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: stalker power armor -->
  <Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor.label>潛獵裝甲</Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor.label>
  <!-- EN: A monolith power armor, inspired by glitterworld's space marines. This armor possess the best armor rating by utilizing plasteel to its highest capacity, renders the wearer immune to toxic fallout and necrotion fallout, provides immunity to fire, and can deploy reloadable broad shields for extra protection. The stalker power armor was created in response to the necronoid threat, providing mankind an edge to combat the necronoids and keeping them at bay. -->
  <Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor.description>以閃耀世界太空陸戰隊的制式裝備為靈感研發而成的一體式動力裝甲，是協助人類對抗歿疫感染體威脅的有力幫手。由於在製造時盡可能多地使用了塑鋼，潛獵裝甲不僅擁有極強的防護性能，還能使穿戴者不受毒霧霾和歿疫霧霾的影響。它還額外搭載有可復用式低角護盾部署裝置，大大提高了被遠程武器集火時的生存能力。</Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor.description>
  <!-- EN: reload -->
  <Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>護盾</Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>冷卻中</Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: deploy low-shield -->
  <Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor.verbs.deploy_lowshield.label>部署低角護盾</Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor.verbs.deploy_lowshield.label>
  
  <!-- EN: imperial monolith power armor -->
  <Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor_Empire.label>帝國潛獵裝甲</Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor_Empire.label>
  <!-- EN: A special imperial power armor, mainly worn by skilled necro hunters of the empire. Unlike the original stalker power armor, the imperial monolith power armor possess better damage resistance, and offers greater mobility by removing the shield pack deployer and installing enhanced servo units in the leg joints. Such a protective gear further solidifies the empire's title as the bulwark against the necronoid threat, and further solidifes their power throughout the rim. -->
  <Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor_Empire.description>通常由破碎帝國中最老練的歿疫獵人們使用的特殊動力裝甲。與普通的潛獵裝甲有所不同，帝國潛獵裝甲擁有更優秀的防護性能，其原本的低角護盾部署裝置被拆除，取而代之的是能提高穿戴者機動性的腿部增幅傳動系統。這種裝備的問世不僅鞏固了破碎帝國作為抗擊歿疫感染體的主力軍的地位，也強化了他們在邊緣世界中的軍事影響力。</Apparel_StalkerPowerArmor_Empire.description>
  
</LanguageData>